# configs/
#
# Purpose: Runtime configuration files (YAML, JSON, TOML) for different
# environments (development, staging, production).
#
# Example files that will be added in later milestones:
#   - model_config.yaml       — hyperparameter defaults for training
#   - feature_config.yaml     — feature names, types, and encoding rules
#   - monitoring_config.yaml  — drift detection thresholds
#
# All sensitive values (passwords, API keys) belong in environment variables
# or a secrets manager, NOT in this directory.
